fix:
Split the read operation and write operation into two distinct, functional methods.
```impl ReportGenerator {
    fn print_summary(&self) {
        for line in &self.data { println!("{}", line); }
    }
    fn clear_cache(&mut self) {
        self.data.clear();
    }
}
